{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e225817d9b47d86ccee82b5916476c25d8618968aa5fb9b012d19ec19005adfa", "ja": "（人気ゲーム『ピコモン』とのコラボが決まり、海美が\n主人公をモチーフにした衣装を着ることになった）", "zh": "（我们决定和热门游戏《皮可梦》联动，海美要穿上以主角为原型的服装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f577094926117dcf17c6f15ea6b1158312112ce0984b192959ad1fd02d46f7bf", "ja": "{$P$}、どう？\nちゃんと主人公っぽい感じ出てるかな？", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么样？\n有没有好好展现出主角的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ec5d2bb8695bf426ffdbfdd359920b4810b9b5603d5dff5442e8ca8bf50605b0", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ！\n主人公の元気な感じが、海美によく似合ってる。", "zh": "啊，非常棒！\n主人公那种活力十足的感觉，很适合海美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "458e9ab942c4a8d63a2296458f9998c7040972f6a775a61c281791c55a1f8d03", "ja": "えへへ、よかった♪\nこれでゲームの主人公になれたから……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n这样我就成了游戏的主角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "e3c925301e22de55dd67d34d9e9b98c6157d3d4387231f639b96f91c8417e23d", "ja": "あとは、本当にピコモンがいたら完璧だねっ☆\n現実の世界にもいてくれたらいいのにな～。", "zh": "之后要是真有皮可蒙在就完美啦☆\n现实世界里也有的话该有多好啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a89d7e03b7b7b9f0726fc65bc8aea5e8a1b5a979b361e749d74d55a5538a282c", "ja": "はは、ゲームファンの夢だよな。", "zh": "哈哈，这可是游戏迷的梦想啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "f26613f2501944f60b7496f03e65a7555b59e9118ba6ac70149b74a76f9df982", "ja": "だよね、だよねっ！　私も『ピコモン』で遊んでるけど\nカワイイモンスターがいっぱいなんだ～。", "zh": "对吧，对吧！我也在玩《皮可兽》，里面有好多可爱的怪兽呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "6bb45d69fed8d0ed50aad2abd8236f5d155f94b734677c1ffbd4f14c687ae942", "ja": "ピンクですっごくカワイイピコモンがいたんだけど、\n捕まえるのが大変でさ……。", "zh": "有一只粉色的超可爱皮科蒙，不过要抓到它可费劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "5dc2389741f601bb9094066a1c27af6830e85fbe9bdf9159157d1060c58d184b", "ja": "でも遊びながら、一緒にやりたいな～ってこととか、\nいっぱい考えたりしてるんだ！", "zh": "不过，我也想过很多，比如一边玩一边和它一起做些什么～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d35799325926f881874e70f9b278a0ae86bef38dd7f7d24697c857cf0542147e", "ja": "へぇ。海美とピコモンか……\n一緒に運動したり、冒険したりしてそうだな？", "zh": "哦，海美和ピコモン啊……感觉会一起运动、一起冒险吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "4026a2857302bf3b2af54b5b68d78c625b4e31fc5d944513480fe0852f4705a6", "ja": "えっ！　なんでわかったの！？　毎朝一緒に\nランニングできたら楽しそうだなって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "诶！你怎么知道的！？我正想着，要是每天早上能一起跑步，肯定会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6c727dbb0a17c5f63ddbc00c992994d09f7c0a8e7efec407b7248f0970b2abc", "ja": "あとは、一緒にお買い物に行って、\nカワイイ服とか、選んであげたいなーって。", "zh": "还有就是，好想一起去逛街买东西，\n帮她挑挑可爱的衣服什么的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "ef0c393ea1fc7553a3bebfdd6e318f1365dc3555cd2c3126fb5f417a7758d7d5", "ja": "私とお揃いにして、一緒に街を歩くの！\nもう考えただけで、すっごく素敵だよね☆", "zh": "要和我穿成一样，一起走在街上！光是想想就觉得特别棒吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1ad9b0a2fadbc2bf57bc6ab345f1b90641dfcf71afb3297741b7af53c07c60a5", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n実際に、仲の良い友達同士でやってる人もいるしな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n实际上，也有人会和关系要好的朋友一起这样做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "56af3c2b4279beac98bef37f2978edb0e16ff5f4e1746df9af668494a920f611", "ja": "でしょ～！　たとえば、この衣装も！\nピコモンとお揃いにしたら、カワイイよね♪", "zh": "对吧～！比如这套服装也是！\n要是和皮可萌穿成同款，就很可爱了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "4d7235619da5b840fc88d152190722b3c42155eae612c2063007c36b53947835", "ja": "あ～、{$P$}と話してたら、\n本当にやりたくなってきちゃった～！", "zh": "啊～跟{$P$}这么一聊，\n我真的越来越想办了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "de946e75fb2d48590f61bfbca57690681083004768ab350222adbeed3bc8e252", "ja": "ははっ。それなら、本当にやってみたらどうだ？\nそれこそ真美とペアルックとか。", "zh": "哈哈。既然这样，那就真的试试看怎么样？\n比如和真美穿情侣装之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b55106b881883208131b4e004c18c535721d9d069b70bfe9c2309ffcefeee34", "ja": "真美と……あ、それいいかも！\n私も真美と同じ服着たりしたい！", "zh": "和真美……啊，这个主意不错！\n我也想和真美穿一样的衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "b572c5a194460f82ee49a7fe890f0e89a81c0364d21f3b434bbe70c58bdeebe8", "ja": "お揃いの格好で街を歩いたりして！？　うわーっ、\nすっごく楽しそう！　あとで真美に話してみよーっと☆", "zh": "穿着同款的衣服一起在街上逛逛！？哇——，\n感觉一定超有意思！待会儿去跟真美说说看～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0524_1019_p", "source_sha256": "09a88a332036e4f744899ac2c29df9b5ca65a9766a0b9c2e0f6bb7b4592ae0b7", "ja": "（その後、海美と真美がペアルックで遊んでる写真が\n届いた。二人の仲が深まったみたいで、よかった！）", "zh": "（之后，海美和真美穿着情侣装一起玩耍的照片送了过来。看来两人的关系更亲密了，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
